WEBVTT

00:19.850 --> 00:22.310
install a self-destruct device

00:19.850 --> 00:22.310
Jibaku souchi wa

00:22.480 --> 00:26.020
as an option

00:22.480 --> 00:26.020
opshon tsukete kure

00:27.690 --> 00:28.820
If I

00:27.690 --> 00:28.820
Kimi o

00:28.990 --> 00:31.410
can't protect you

00:28.990 --> 00:31.410
Mamotte yarenai nara

00:31.570 --> 00:32.700
living

00:31.570 --> 00:32.700
Ikiteru

00:32.870 --> 00:33.990
has no meaning

00:32.870 --> 00:33.990
imi nai

00:34.160 --> 00:36.910
at all to me

00:34.160 --> 00:36.910
ore na no dakara

00:37.870 --> 00:40.330
Even if I had my erased memories back

00:37.870 --> 00:40.330
Kesareta kioku ni sae mo

00:40.460 --> 00:42.920
I wouldn't remember the two of us

00:40.460 --> 00:42.920
futari no omoide nai

00:43.170 --> 00:47.840
That's my one-sided and self-destructive love

00:43.170 --> 00:47.840
Sou wansaido jibaku no aisa

00:48.840 --> 00:50.800
I am still young

00:48.840 --> 00:50.800
Atara wakai

00:50.970 --> 00:54.260
but willing to exchange my life for yours

00:50.970 --> 00:54.260
Inochi o hikikaeshita tote kamawanai

00:55.430 --> 00:57.060
I'll become

00:55.430 --> 00:57.060
Kimi no

00:57.640 --> 00:59.310
your hero

00:57.640 --> 00:59.310
hiiroo ni naru

00:59.600 --> 01:01.890
If you are

00:59.600 --> 01:01.890
kimi ga akutou de

01:02.100 --> 01:06.270
kidnapped by villains

01:02.100 --> 01:06.270
saratte kureta nara

01:06.650 --> 01:10.690
You can upgrade me as you please

01:06.650 --> 01:10.690
katte ni kaizou shite mo ii ze

01:11.110 --> 01:14.700
Katte Ni

01:11.110 --> 01:14.700
Kaizou

01:11.110 --> 01:14.700
[Elesa-Suimasen] presents

01:11.570 --> 01:14.700
Katte Ni

01:11.570 --> 01:14.700
Kaizou

01:15.120 --> 01:19.950
Second year student of Torauma High School, Katsu Kaizō is a cyborg.

01:19.950 --> 01:23.710
Attacked by mysterious people and left close to death with severe injuries

01:23.710 --> 01:26.840
he was turned into a cyborg by genius scientist Saien Suzu

01:26.840 --> 01:29.130
which saved his life.

01:29.130 --> 01:31.510
She brought along with her the underling Tsubouchi Chitan

01:31.510 --> 01:34.300
along with whom Kaizō continues his fight.

01:35.260 --> 01:38.760
Or at least, this is what he imagines.

01:46.550 --> 01:48.310
<i>You can't say anything anymore.</i>

01:48.460 --> 01:52.240
Once you've taken it that far, nothing more can be said!

01:50.300 --> 01:52.460
• Real Madrid's bench-packing • The 101st proposal

01:50.500 --> 01:52.460
• The twist in Siberian Express  • Novala-sensei's fashion

01:50.750 --> 01:52.460
• The Kanou Sisters' luxurious lifestyle • The sequels of <i>Friday the 13th</i>

01:50.950 --> 01:52.460
• Putting Kuno-san's joke on TV unedited

01:51.200 --> 01:52.460
• Lotte's 18 defeats in a row • Hashiba Hideyoshi's house • Toroi's wooden horse

01:51.500 --> 01:52.460
• The Ootsuka Clinic commercials (CG) • Adachi Yumi's Mom's Maiden Heart

01:51.700 --> 01:52.460
• Hirosue's eccentricity • Kubozuka-kun's world • Miwa Akihiro's Beauty

01:51.950 --> 01:52.460
• Japanet's own expense policy • The Steel Battalion controller

01:52.200 --> 01:52.460
• Kobayashi Sachiko's red/white fashion

01:52.800 --> 01:54.220
That's true, isn't it?

01:54.260 --> 01:56.770
If it's taken to that length, you just have to accept it.

01:56.880 --> 01:59.840
If you only commit to it half-way, people will complain.

01:59.910 --> 02:00.780
Commitment?

02:01.060 --> 02:02.620
You know about the border incident?

02:03.030 --> 02:07.260
The French Navy landed via a port that wasn't declared as an open border

02:07.260 --> 02:10.050
so naturally the Tosa-han samurai killed them.

02:10.770 --> 02:13.470
In order to appease the French ambassador

02:13.470 --> 02:17.180
the government ordered 20 samurai to kill themselves.

02:17.790 --> 02:20.420
So the French ambassador could confirm it

02:20.780 --> 02:23.010
the samurai were ordered to commit suicide in his presence.

02:23.160 --> 02:26.890
The samurai cut their bellies and were beheaded one after another

02:26.890 --> 02:29.010
as the French ambassador became pale with horror.

02:29.240 --> 02:31.380
Again and again!

02:32.080 --> 02:34.750
In the end, the ambassador couldn't take it anymore and ran away.

02:36.150 --> 02:38.340
And it seems he never said anything more about the incident afterwards.

02:38.770 --> 02:42.220
Because it was taken to that extreme the French people were unable to protest.

02:42.380 --> 02:44.830
Just why are you so well-informed about stuff that involves killing people!?

02:45.960 --> 02:46.830
Morning!

02:51.160 --> 02:53.010
That doesn't suit him at all, how gross!

02:53.010 --> 02:55.430
He should take a look at himself in a mirror!

02:56.560 --> 02:59.040
What's with all this criticism all of sudden?!

02:59.110 --> 03:00.550
It's because it's half-assed!

03:01.990 --> 03:03.480
Leave it to me...

03:07.050 --> 03:09.580
If I go that far, nobody will say anything anymore.

03:11.000 --> 03:12.200
It's the same thing with lies.

03:12.520 --> 03:15.560
If you tell one or two small lies, people will complain.

03:16.130 --> 03:17.640
Umi-chan, you liar!!

03:17.820 --> 03:20.060
There's hasn't been any fire in Class 3!!

03:20.430 --> 03:21.910
It's a true story!

03:22.460 --> 03:24.290
I saw it with these very eyes!

03:24.820 --> 03:27.800
The ones who started the fire were giants 3 meters tall!

03:29.150 --> 03:33.180
They were slimy and had eyes like snails!

03:33.250 --> 03:37.260
They told me via telepathy that the next fire will be in this classroom!

03:37.410 --> 03:40.060
I...Is that so? Well, then I believe you...

03:40.550 --> 03:41.640
And that's how it went.

03:41.970 --> 03:43.700
You just said it in a way they couldn't respond to!!

03:44.060 --> 03:45.620
It's the same with scars on your wrist.

03:45.830 --> 03:48.320
If it's just 1 or 2, people will get mad at you and tell you to stop it.

03:48.390 --> 03:52.160
But if you have countless cross-shaped cuts, they won't say anything!

03:52.310 --> 03:54.020
Because they don't want to set you off!

03:54.400 --> 03:55.020
<i>Ouch!</i>

03:55.470 --> 03:58.000
Umi-chan, why did you leave a scythe on the floor?!

03:58.360 --> 04:00.230
If people step on that, they'll get hurt!

04:00.660 --> 04:01.990
Apologize!!

04:02.170 --> 04:03.260
That's right, apologize!

04:04.350 --> 04:06.820
If you cause trouble in a half-assed way

04:07.220 --> 04:08.300
you'll get complaints.

04:21.260 --> 04:23.460
Killing one person is a crime

04:23.730 --> 04:26.440
but killing a thousand people makes you a hero!

04:27.020 --> 04:29.720
I'll show you what it means!!

04:30.120 --> 04:33.130
I'll show you!!

04:34.410 --> 04:38.580
After that, nobody said anything to Umi-chan anymore.

04:38.640 --> 04:40.270
Isn't that already a major incident?!

04:40.560 --> 04:45.900
However, there is a grain of truth in what Umi-chan said.

04:46.180 --> 04:49.200
If you do bad things half-assed, you'll get scolded.

04:52.490 --> 04:54.210
Mebae Police Station

04:54.600 --> 04:58.460
If it's done that brazenly, you're left at a loss for words.

05:05.320 --> 05:07.590
If I go this far, it's not a crime anymore, is it?

05:08.860 --> 05:09.910
It is.

05:11.580 --> 05:14.140
Isn't there something wrong with this story?

05:15.590 --> 05:19.280
<i>It was his usual way to school.</i>

05:19.700 --> 05:21.420
<i>Will he make it in time?</i>

05:22.070 --> 05:23.530
<i>A railway-crossing that won't open...</i>

05:23.630 --> 05:24.840
<i>A jam-packed train...</i>

05:25.230 --> 05:27.870
<i>One tragedy after the other awaits him...</i>

05:28.930 --> 05:29.930
Gum, please.

05:30.440 --> 05:32.680
<i>Meetings ... and partings.</i>

05:32.930 --> 05:35.510
<i>And what he saw at the end of his journey was...?</i>

05:35.890 --> 05:41.330
Starring in:

05:36.600 --> 05:38.090
<i>"The Underlingman Show"</i>

05:38.340 --> 05:39.660
<i>"Torauma Graffiti" and</i>

05:39.790 --> 05:41.350
<i>"Siberian Express Underling"</i>

05:41.350 --> 05:42.820
<i>Tsubouchi Chitan!</i>

05:42.930 --> 05:44.930
Acclaimed Worldwide!

