05:59.000 --> 06:00.470
Thank you!

06:05.440 --> 06:07.370
What fun!

06:10.280 --> 06:13.260
The Just Barely * Circus

06:33.730 --> 06:35.170
Awesome!

06:54.130 --> 06:55.600
Screw Up!

06:58.090 --> 06:59.440
SCREW UP!

07:02.000 --> 07:05.420
Could you please stop that Miss, it's bad luck!!

07:02.000 --> 07:03.520
SCREW UP!

07:06.070 --> 07:07.340
Piece ... of ...

07:07.520 --> 07:08.790
Meat?

07:09.040 --> 07:11.680
Piece ... of ... meat ...

07:11.990 --> 07:15.350
Sorry, it's just that she's a little slow.

07:15.350 --> 07:20.220
Oh ... well, that's all right, we're happy she's getting a thrill out of it.

07:20.310 --> 07:22.060
You can tell from her reaction

07:22.060 --> 07:24.960
that she really feels the excitement of walking the tightrope.

07:26.670 --> 07:28.000
Wh... what's so funny!?

07:26.870 --> 07:27.960
Piece of Meat!

07:29.160 --> 07:31.240
Well... it's just that...

07:29.940 --> 07:30.850
Piece of Meat!

07:33.670 --> 07:36.390
I was wondering if <i><b>you aren't lacking that feeling of walking a tightrope.</b></i>

07:38.790 --> 07:40.120
What's that?!

07:39.430 --> 07:40.310
Screw Up!

07:40.300 --> 07:44.100
How can you say our circus lacks the feeling of walking a tightrope?!

07:40.470 --> 07:41.330
Piece of Meat!

07:42.770 --> 07:44.700
Meat! Meat! Meat!

07:44.710 --> 07:45.960
How should I put this...

07:44.710 --> 07:45.920
Screw Up!

07:45.940 --> 07:48.680
Necessity is the
mother of invention

07:46.750 --> 07:48.680
You aren't going about it the right way...

07:48.690 --> 07:51.080
 Urgent

07:49.350 --> 07:51.080
or maybe without a feeling of urgency, I should say.

07:51.630 --> 07:53.230
If you want, just follow me!

07:53.840 --> 07:55.850
Let me show you how it really feels to walk a tightrope!

08:01.450 --> 08:03.720
A circus tent here...?!

08:04.230 --> 08:08.640
Here, you'll be able to see <i>real  </i>thrilling tightrope walking.

08:11.340 --> 08:13.030
Look, it's starting!

08:17.490 --> 08:20.500
That just looks like a boy facing a mirror...

08:28.360 --> 08:31.900
I can't watch this! They could fall out at any moment!

08:32.450 --> 08:35.910
Precisely! He's combing his thin hair and it's about to fall out!

08:36.830 --> 08:39.740
This is <i>truly</i>

08:39.740 --> 08:42.410
walking the tightrope!

08:45.110 --> 08:47.250
All right, all right! Just stop already!

08:47.470 --> 08:49.690
My heart is about to explode!

08:49.690 --> 08:50.890
I can't watch this!

08:50.890 --> 08:53.020
The thrilling feeling of walking a tightrope!

08:53.020 --> 08:55.130
This is a <i>real </i> circus!

08:55.980 --> 09:00.430
But Mor**ng Musume absolutely refused to come and cheer...

09:01.100 --> 09:02.550
Well, pull yourself together.

09:02.870 --> 09:04.660
The next performance is about to start!

09:05.570 --> 09:07.180
We were just at your circus

09:07.180 --> 09:09.850
which had a unicycle tightrope act.

09:10.220 --> 09:11.850
But the unicycle acrobatics here

09:12.220 --> 09:14.250
make that look like child's play!

09:14.720 --> 09:15.540
 Ookawa Industries (Returned merchandise)

09:15.960 --> 09:17.870
It's time to make the payment!

09:18.040 --> 09:20.290
We're about to default again!

09:21.480 --> 09:23.780
I need to get to the bank by 3 o'clock...

09:23.780 --> 09:25.370
If I do, we can borrow some more money

09:25.370 --> 09:28.430
and pay the employees' wages with that...

09:28.800 --> 09:29.900
This... can't be...!

09:30.070 --> 09:30.370
It is!

09:31.170 --> 09:33.720
A repeating cycle of lending, repaying, lending, and repaying!

09:34.560 --> 09:35.920
It's a Cycle Operation!

09:40.260 --> 09:41.740
Unlimited

09:47.090 --> 09:48.430
I can't keep watching this!

09:48.430 --> 09:50.780
They could fall into default again any minute!

09:51.130 --> 09:52.030
By the way, over there...

09:52.750 --> 09:54.910
that man's wife is experiencing the tightrope feeling as well.

09:55.270 --> 09:56.600
Home Loan

09:55.370 --> 09:56.370
They have a mortgage to pay...

09:56.850 --> 09:58.530
and their son is about to enter high school...

09:57.390 --> 09:58.530
Starting High School

09:58.940 --> 10:01.040
She's hastily running around supermarkets to look for special offers...

10:01.250 --> 10:04.160
Doing nothing but collecting coupons and stamps...

10:05.040 --> 10:07.230
Somehow managing to stay within the family budget

10:07.230 --> 10:08.520
just like walking a tightrope!

10:08.730 --> 10:09.430
Quite simply...

10:10.680 --> 10:11.930
A Make-Do Circus!

10:13.760 --> 10:16.380
I just said something clever, didn't I?

10:17.760 --> 10:20.080
It kind of sounds like "Gimmick Circus".

10:20.180 --> 10:21.860
"Make-Do" and "Gimmick"!

10:21.880 --> 10:24.900
I get it! Stop explaining it already, you're making it worse!

10:26.270 --> 10:29.270
Thank you for your patience! The star of the circus...

10:29.270 --> 10:29.980
That's right!

10:30.290 --> 10:32.650
Even the mascot of this circus

10:32.650 --> 10:34.870
almost makes you feel like you're walking a tightrope!

10:34.960 --> 10:36.870
Making his entrance - Mecky-kun!

10:39.150 --> 10:41.720
No! You can't do that! That's too much walking the tightrope!

10:41.860 --> 10:45.660
This is a tightrope walk - will we get sued or not?!

10:46.090 --> 10:47.880
This is <b>real</b> circus!

10:48.400 --> 10:51.970
You can see everyday circuses like this everywhere...

10:51.970 --> 10:54.690
• Going to school without wearing pants • Date business methods
• Installing the horns on a Char Zaku
• Market prices for Azuki • Eggs from a week ago
• A double affair • Traveling to Iraq • NTV's correspondent Imaizumi
• Going to the sauna at a gay cruising spot • O-Takara Girls
• Misugi-kun being on the field for 45 minutes • The deadline this time

10:56.430 --> 10:58.600
What kind of tightrope walking will we have this time?

10:58.980 --> 11:02.470
I'm removing the affected area without damaging any nerves at all.

11:02.840 --> 11:04.650
If I even shake a little, it's over.

11:05.240 --> 11:06.830
This has never been done successfully.

11:07.520 --> 11:09.770
Please stop! This is too much of a tightrope walk!

11:09.770 --> 11:12.470
Please stop walking a tightrope when it involves a human life!

11:12.630 --> 11:14.890
Even Dr. Black Jack can't do this!

11:15.010 --> 11:16.890
Speaking of Black Jack...

11:17.300 --> 11:18.760
If we add a "With regards"

11:19.000 --> 11:20.480
we can use it as a title!

11:20.480 --> 11:21.410
<i>With regards to -</i>

11:21.680 --> 11:22.390
In that case-!

11:22.950 --> 11:24.660
For example, "With regards to One P*iece"...

11:22.950 --> 11:24.660
With Regards To

11:25.360 --> 11:27.160
or "With Regards to Saza*-san"...

11:27.970 --> 11:29.700
or "With Regards to Harry **tter"...

11:30.330 --> 11:31.700
all could be used, right?!

11:32.360 --> 11:35.620
That gives you the feeling of walking a tightrope, doesn't it?

11:35.620 --> 11:38.050
I think some people will get really upset!

11:38.330 --> 11:41.000
You don't need to make the rope this thin on purpose!

11:41.000 --> 11:43.300
Just make it "With regards to Touch"!

11:43.490 --> 11:44.560
Huh?

11:45.020 --> 11:47.410
But that's a Shogakukan title and it even runs in "Sunday"...

11:47.800 --> 11:51.160
I don't think the customers will appreciate a rope that thick!

11:51.160 --> 11:52.980
It'll be just fine!

11:53.260 --> 11:55.390
The ropes here are too thin in the first place.

11:55.580 --> 11:59.560
You need a rope at least this thick to make it funny!

11:59.960 --> 12:04.780
<i>(*0*)/I think work is a waste of time (-. -)y* * The legendary NEET has spoken >I'm hoping for a 5000000 Yen annual salary!</i>

11:59.960 --> 12:01.420
Well, you may be right.

12:01.460 --> 12:04.780
I guess these days, the rope needs to be thick.

12:06.480 --> 12:07.080
Hey you!

12:07.240 --> 12:08.580
This is so dangerous, I can't keep watching!

12:08.960 --> 12:10.230
Let's make the rope thicker.

12:10.400 --> 12:13.140
Make the rope thicker... do you mean...

12:13.520 --> 12:17.530
Giving me more and thicker hair?!

12:18.020 --> 12:19.530
No, that's not it...

12:21.350 --> 12:22.140
What's this?

12:22.290 --> 12:23.810
A safety comb for you.

12:24.360 --> 12:25.970
If you use this when brushing

12:25.970 --> 12:27.400
it won't be as dangerous!

12:37.740 --> 12:40.990
You're right! I can brush without worry with this!

12:41.070 --> 12:42.220
However...

12:42.380 --> 12:46.780
He wasn't aware that some tightrope walking was going on elsewhere...

12:48.330 --> 12:49.260
Between this world...

12:48.330 --> 12:49.260
That World

12:48.330 --> 12:49.260
This World

12:49.640 --> 12:51.730
and that world...

12:51.900 --> 12:53.940
Welcome to the Hall of Life.

12:56.670 --> 12:59.120
These are the lights of human lives.

12:59.460 --> 13:01.350
When the light of a candle dies

13:01.350 --> 13:03.900
the life of that person is ended.

13:03.900 --> 13:06.990
Oh dear, there's a leak...!

13:07.880 --> 13:08.720
Tsubouchi
Chitan

13:21.660 --> 13:24.010
We made my rope thicker!

13:24.270 --> 13:26.140
This isn't tightrope-walking anymore.

13:27.400 --> 13:28.940
<i>News Flash</i>

13:29.530 --> 13:31.620
<i>The whole world is afraid...</i>

13:32.170 --> 13:34.880
Let's see, what should I eat next?

13:35.350 --> 13:36.520
<i>Getting eaten...</i>

13:37.100 --> 13:39.250
Getting eaten one after another...<i></i>

13:39.250 --> 13:41.470
<i>Wieners... Tamago-Yaki... Chikuwa...</i>

13:41.470 --> 13:43.470
<i>Dribbling Meat Soup...</i>

13:43.470 --> 13:45.030
<i>Splashing Ketchup...</i>

13:45.830 --> 13:48.290
<i>She eats it all!</i>

13:48.620 --> 13:52.690
<i>Not suitable for viewers under 15 years of age.</i>

13:48.620 --> 13:52.690
<i>Can you withstand this terrifying appetite?</i>

13:52.890 --> 13:54.890
The whole world
is screaming!!

13:52.890 --> 13:54.890
"I saw this and
couldn't eat for the
next three days. 
– Puuko (Fashion Critic)

13:52.890 --> 13:54.890
"Do not watch this alone."
- Torauma Times

13:52.890 --> 13:54.890
"3 frightening things mixed
together – Magnum Horror..."
– Shonen *ump

13:52.890 --> 13:54.890
"This work has changed the
history of gourmets!"
- Kawagoe Tatsuya (Cook)

